Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:21.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how's everything going in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:21.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谈得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:22.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:22.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I may have asked all my questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想问题我都问完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good. Do you have questions for Erica?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好  你们有什么要问她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:28.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:28.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想问问
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you read a file that you liked...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你读到满意的申请表
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:32.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then you gave the agency the serial number
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:32.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后告诉代理人编号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:34.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and they contacted us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:34.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后他们联系到我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:36.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Our system ensures total anonymity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:36.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的系统中用户完全匿名
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:37.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're very proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:37.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们以此为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:42.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're really on top of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:42.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的是一流
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:45.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well then, if there's nothing else,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:45.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别的没什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}then the two of us should talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们俩谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I actually....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实际上…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:51.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I don't think we have to. - We don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:51.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我想我们不必谈了 -为什么不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, when I read about you two,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看了你们的档案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was pretty sure I wanted you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就确定要选你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.57,0:11:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I just thought we should meet face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.57,0:11:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但还想当面见见你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:59.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I choose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就选他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:04.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:04.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  天啊  太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is so great. Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了  听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:08.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:08.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的  听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:13.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:13.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  太谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:17.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are so going to heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:17.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你将来一定进天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We got some really great stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们买了些很棒的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:29.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but I'm not sure about some of the bras I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:29.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是  有些胸罩似乎不妥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:32.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Do you want to try some of them on for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:32.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的  你能穿上试给我看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:33.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:36.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, are we in Joey's imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:36.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下  我们是在乔伊的幻想里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:42.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no. I took one of Ross' bags by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:42.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}糟糕  错拿罗斯一袋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And one of mine is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我那件不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:45.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross probably has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:45.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肯定在罗斯那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll get it from him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找他拿回来好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:13:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we're not wearing the same shirt anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:13:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这下我们再也撞不了衫了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Yeah, Rachel picked it out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  瑞秋帮我选的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She told me to trust her, and you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她让我相信她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm glad I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真高兴我答应了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I turned quite a few heads on my way over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一路过来回头率暴高
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:15.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dude, I really don't think you should be wearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:15.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄  别穿成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:17.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:17.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:21.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody's afraid of a little competition with the ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人怕我抢走了女人的目光
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:25.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Looks like someone is the ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:25.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看起来好用某人就是个女人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're just jealous because you couldn't pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你嫉妒  因为你不能把这件扒下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:33.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Now if you'll excuse me, I have a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:33.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在失陪了  我约会去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:38.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? All eyes on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:38.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到没  大家都只看我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:46.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are not signing those papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:46.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能签
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:47.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:47.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为啥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:50.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's wrong. They made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:50.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样做不对  他们搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They think we're somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:51.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我们是别人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:54.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God works in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:54.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上帝的安排  凡人懂什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:56.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have got to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:56.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再冒充了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:59.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But she liked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:59.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她喜欢我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:01.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She likes Doctor Chandler
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:01.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她喜欢的是钱德勒医生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and Reverend Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和莫妮卡牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:06.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm kind of like a reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:06.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我其实满像牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:09.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, as a chef, I serve God
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:09.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}作为主厨  我给饥饿的人和穷人提供食物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:12.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}by feeding the hungry and poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:12.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不也是为上帝服务
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:16.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your veal chop is 34.95!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:16.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们一份小牛排卖34块9毛5
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:18.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:18.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:20.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just-- I think we've been given an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:20.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幸福来敲门了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:22.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The mistake's already made.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:22.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不如将错就错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're writing up the papers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们已经在写书面报告了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we're not the ones she chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们不是她要选的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can you feel okay about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你竟然理直气壮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:35.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We may not be who she thinks we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:35.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我们不是她选中的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but no one will ever love that baby more than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但没人会比我们更爱那个小娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:40.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I know.  - I mean, who knows...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:40.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我明白  -我的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:41.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...how long it's gonna take for someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:41.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁知道我们到底还要等多久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to give us a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才会有人再选我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if no one ever picks us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一永远没人选我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:47.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, honey....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:47.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:51.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please. We are so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:51.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}求你了  我们就快要成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:56.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, I want a baby too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:56.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  我也想要孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But this woman is giving away her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她要送出他的心肝宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She deserves to know who it's going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她应该知道对方的真实身份
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  你说的没错
