Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.07,0:20:49.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是医生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-啊   -不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could perform an operation on you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你愿意  我可以替你开刀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:55.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and prove it if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:55.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}向你证明
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:59.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to check your file. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:59.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去查档案  失陪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:01.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:01.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our names really are Monica and Chandler. We're from New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是叫莫妮卡和钱德勒  纽约来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:07.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but the important thing to know about us...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:07.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但重要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is how much we would care for this little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们真的很爱这个小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.13,0:21:13.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you lied to me before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.13,0:21:13.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们先前跟我撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:16.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we "bore false witness."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们"犯了伪证罪"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:20.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? I could be a reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:20.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看  我真有当牧师的天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:25.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we were hoping that since we told you the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:25.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们希望说明真相后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that you still might consider--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能网开一面...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.63,0:21:29.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Giving you my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.63,0:21:29.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把我的宝贝给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:31.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think I'd give you my child after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:31.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生这一切后  你们以为还会给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have to decide now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不必马上决定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:34.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you look at our file--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:34.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请看看我们的档案
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want to look at your file. This is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没兴趣  到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Erica, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾瑞卡  请等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:45.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have nothing to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:45.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你无话可说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:48.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, you have every reason to be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:48.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有任何理由生气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:49.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We did lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:49.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是撒了谎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:51.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But only because we've been waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:51.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:54.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and trying to have a baby for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:54.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们想要个孩子等太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:56.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we don't know how long it's gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:56.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们也不知道下一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:57.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}before we get another chance again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:57.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}何年何月才会到来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you ask the reverend to pray on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你的牧师祈祷去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:03.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Erica, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:03.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾瑞卡  求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just consider us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}考虑一下我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:07.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ask them to see our file.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:07.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找他们要我们的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our last name's Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们姓宾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.79,0:22:12.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My wife's a chef, and I'm in advertising.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.79,0:22:12.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我太太是个主厨  我从事广告业
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.67,0:22:15.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.67,0:22:15.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I actually liked you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的确喜欢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:20.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:20.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但已经不重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:21.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because what you did was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:21.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不该撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:23.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you did like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:23.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你喜欢我们对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也应该喜欢我们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.07,0:22:29.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My wife's an incredible woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.07,0:22:29.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我太太是个很了不起的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She is loving, and devoted and caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有爱心  乐于奉献  关怀他人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.95,0:22:35.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And don't tell her I said this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.95,0:22:35.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别告诉她我这么说过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but the woman's always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:37.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她一贯正确
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love my wife more than anything in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱我太太胜过世上一切事物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:47.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:47.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:52.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It kills me that I can't give her a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:52.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能给她个孩子我难受死了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:22:59.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really want a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:22:59.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很想要个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.53,0:23:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And when that day finally comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.53,0:23:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有了孩子以后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.85,0:23:04.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll learn how to be a good dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.85,0:23:04.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会学习如何做是个好爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But my wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我太太...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.91,0:23:09.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she's already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.91,0:23:09.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她已经是个好妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:12.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's a mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:12.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是一个妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.49,0:23:15.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...without a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.49,0:23:15.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可惜没孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.87,0:23:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.87,0:23:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You still want that baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还想要那个孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.21,0:23:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God bless you, Chandler Bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.21,0:23:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上帝保佑你  钱德勒·宾
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.06,0:24:13.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Turns out this sweater is made for a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.06,0:24:13.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原来这件毛衣是女款的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.29,0:24:17.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So why are you still wearing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.29,0:24:17.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你还穿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:18.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because it's soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:18.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以为很软和
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.59,0:24:22.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, so how was your date?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.59,0:24:22.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天过得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.62,0:24:23.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.62,0:24:23.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.47,0:24:29.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, looks like it's just the two of us tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.47,0:24:29.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来今晚就我们两个了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:30.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}huh, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:30.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对吧  哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could do a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有更倒霉的时候呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是阿 -嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:41.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey doesn't share food!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:41.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊从不分享食物
